      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's an interesting distinction. when you mention \"overt demonstrations of interpersonal conflict\" for Mediterranean groups, does that imply a higher tendency toward aggression or volatility in those settings? and for the East Asian group, since they're more \"private\" with coping, does that suggest a tendency toward being more stoic or perhaps even avoidant when things get intense?",
